  "question": {
    "text": "If $A=\\left(\\begin{array}{ll}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & i\\end{array}\\right)$ and $A^{2018}=\\left(\\begin{array}{ll}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{array}\\right)$, then $(a+d)$ equals",
